        "ordinal": 704,
        "reported_page": 45,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_193",
        "table": null,
        "text": "To the Stockholders and the Board of Directors of Alphabet Inc.",
        "text_hash": "6d4c614cbed0428ad9343f084eeadbab7a8eb597b88809a6e88088fbc013ad5d",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000705-e544a467",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 705,
        "reported_page": 45,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_193",
        "table": null,
        "text": "Opinion on the Financial Statements",
        "text_hash": "e544a4671f961786fbf9f88f1d276cc074e112fbb28da97eb1e012beaa2b4048",
        "type": "heading_candidate"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000706-1a7c60ea",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 706,
        "reported_page": 45,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_193",
        "table": null,
        "text": "We have audited the accompanying consolidated balance sheets of Alphabet Inc. (the Company) as of December 31, 2024 and 2025, the related consolidated statements of income, comprehensive income, stockholders' equity and cash flows for each of the three years in the period ended December 31, 2025, and the related notes and financial statement schedule listed in the Index at Item 15 (collectively referred to as the “consolidated financial statements”). In our opinion, the consolidated financial statements present fairly, in all material respects, the financial position of the Company at December 31, 2024 and 2025, and the results of its operations and its cash flows for each of the three years in the period ended December 31, 2025, in conformity with U.S. generally accepted accounting principles.",
        "text_hash": "1a7c60ea301ed10349e60f4a58f3e08b3fe345e3b5962876742e134f704dbebe",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000707-cb7bcec3",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 707,
        "reported_page": 45,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_193",
        "table": null,
        "text": "We also have audited, in accordance with the standards of the Public Company Accounting Oversight Board (United States) (PCAOB), the Company's internal control over financial reporting as of December 31, 2025, based on criteria established in Internal Control—Integrated Framework issued by the Committee of Sponsoring Organizations of the Treadway Commission (2013 framework), and our report dated February 4, 2026 expressed an unqualified opinion thereon.",
        "text_hash": "cb7bcec3bf68ff4fd4b96b2ff8243e4ab8d4b8c231733c27b30b77795ade588a",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000708-32aee41a",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 708,
        "reported_page": 45,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_193",
        "table": null,
        "text": "Basis for Opinion",
        "text_hash": "32aee41abd47fef59c09d800f79d62da957db9dce88b50f164eeae7bf7ffc314",
        "type": "heading_candidate"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000709-b7d165ae",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 709,
        "reported_page": 45,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_193",
        "table": null,
        "text": "These financial statements are the responsibility of the Company's management. Our responsibility is to express an opinion on the Company’s financial statements based on our audits. We are a public accounting firm registered with the PCAOB and are required to be independent with respect to the Company in accordance with the U.S. federal securities laws and the applicable rules and regulations of the Securities and Exchange Commission and the PCAOB.",
        "text_hash": "b7d165ae075fed166be092b03b346a3c6b64307d02e031192604516ecc09f104",
        "type": "paragraph"
      }
